  "body": "The way this works I think is that an object that implements EventTarget can optionally implement an \"event path computation\" algorithm that returns a list of objects that all implement EventTarget. The dispatch algorithm then uses that.\n\nThis should allow for what we do with nodes and should allow @inexorabletash to use it for IDB.\n\nThis can then serve as a basis for what Shadow DOM needs to modify.\n\nWe should also inline this monkey patch from HTML: https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#events-and-the-window-object.\n",
